WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.800 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:47.120 --> 01:48.440
The sun's gone!

01:50.000 --> 01:51.360
Lu Zhuo!

01:51.440 --> 01:53.480
-Run!
-Everyone run!

01:53.560 --> 01:54.440
Lu Zhuo!

01:54.520 --> 01:56.200
-Get out!
-Run!

01:56.280 --> 01:57.240
Run!

01:57.320 --> 01:58.600
Leave now!

01:58.680 --> 01:59.520
Wei Rao!

02:00.080 --> 02:01.440
Hurry!

02:01.520 --> 02:04.840
-The sun's been swallowed!
-Run!

02:04.920 --> 02:06.360
What should we do?

02:06.440 --> 02:07.680
Move!

02:30.600 --> 02:31.440
Wei Rao!

03:24.160 --> 03:25.960
You knew everything outside was in chaos.

03:26.680 --> 03:29.720
You're always so careful,
so determined to protect yourself.

03:30.320 --> 03:32.200
Why did you throw yourself into the crowd?

03:33.760 --> 03:35.840
If the sun never rose again,

03:38.280 --> 03:40.800
I didn't want to die alone.

03:42.320 --> 03:44.360
I won't let you be alone.

03:53.800 --> 03:54.640
Wei Rao.

03:58.240 --> 03:59.520
How long do I have to wait?

04:01.320 --> 04:05.440
Right here, right now,
I can give you my answer.

04:42.080 --> 04:44.880
This is grander than
a royal princess's wedding!

04:44.960 --> 04:47.520
Her Ladyship is a blessing
to everyone she helps.

04:47.600 --> 04:49.520
She's truly blessed.

04:49.600 --> 04:51.200
To marry a woman like her,

04:51.280 --> 04:52.960
Lord Lu must be the luckiest man alive!

04:55.800 --> 04:58.080
A hero and a beauty,
a match made in heaven!

04:58.160 --> 04:59.520
Congratulations!

05:00.400 --> 05:02.800
May Her Ladyship and Lord Lu
stay together forever

05:02.880 --> 05:03.880
and love each other for life!

06:02.800 --> 06:04.240
Lord Lu is back.

06:13.560 --> 06:15.560
BLISS

06:30.160 --> 06:32.040
You're certainly making yourself at home.

06:33.720 --> 06:34.560
What are you reading?

06:38.720 --> 06:40.640
FARMING METHODS

06:40.720 --> 06:43.120
You're quite devoted to farming,
Your Ladyship.

06:43.840 --> 06:45.000
Even on our wedding night,

06:46.680 --> 06:47.520
you can't put it off.

06:48.320 --> 06:51.280
You took so long,
so I picked up something to read.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.280
What are you looking at?

07:05.320 --> 07:06.560
Just looking, like you.

07:12.080 --> 07:14.320
You're… You're blocking my light.

07:15.320 --> 07:16.280
My mistake.

07:41.840 --> 07:43.080
What are you reading, My Lord?

07:44.120 --> 07:45.120
Curious, Your Ladyship?

07:54.120 --> 07:55.080
It's brighter over here.

08:12.560 --> 08:14.840
When did you steal that? Give it back!

08:22.200 --> 08:23.360
That bridal booklet…

08:25.160 --> 08:26.800
Weren't you the one
who peeked at it first?

08:26.880 --> 08:27.960
Don't you dare bring it up.

08:28.880 --> 08:29.800
Your Ladyship.

08:31.320 --> 08:32.880
Don't you think I'm better than a book?

09:47.080 --> 09:51.120
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

09:51.200 --> 09:56.280
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

09:59.960 --> 10:01.560
I'll take care of it.

10:01.640 --> 10:03.040
But, My Lord…

10:07.120 --> 10:08.600
BLISS

10:48.520 --> 10:49.680
Time to get up.

11:15.920 --> 11:18.560
It's okay. I'm right here.

11:19.560 --> 11:21.040
What time is it?

11:21.920 --> 11:23.960
Shouldn't we be paying our respects
to the elders?

11:26.040 --> 11:27.520
I had someone apologize for us already

11:31.040 --> 11:32.720
The sun's already high in the sky!

11:32.800 --> 11:34.400
You're trying to have me laughed at.

11:34.480 --> 11:35.920
I did try to wake you.

11:36.760 --> 11:37.600
You wouldn't wake up.

11:38.440 --> 11:40.000
And whose fault is that?

11:41.800 --> 11:43.800
Go get Aman to help me get dressed.

11:44.680 --> 11:45.560
All right.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.240
The maids are too slow.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.840
Let me attend to you, Your Ladyship.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.720
Are you crazy? Put me down!

12:08.400 --> 12:13.080
She's the one threatened by the Han family
to falsely accuse our family.

12:13.680 --> 12:15.600
I hear Her Ladyship took her
as a sworn sister.

12:16.200 --> 12:19.080
And from now on,
she'll be living at the Duke's residence.

12:20.120 --> 12:22.280
Wei Rao had the nerve
to marry into this family again.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.840
Grandfather already disapproves of her.

12:24.600 --> 12:27.560
Now she's bringing in some ill-mannered
country girl with no morals.

12:27.640 --> 12:28.960
She's gone too far!

12:30.520 --> 12:32.040
Why are you bringing this up?

12:32.600 --> 12:34.680
Changning, don't go!

12:34.760 --> 12:36.560
Lady Wu'an may throw her weight
around outside,

12:36.640 --> 12:38.520
but once she enters the Duke's residence,

12:38.600 --> 12:40.480
she must obey
the family's rules and elders.

12:41.120 --> 12:43.520
Once Grandfather hears,
she'll be in trouble.

12:45.400 --> 12:46.240
Stop right there!

12:46.920 --> 12:49.880
You're the fraud who set up
our family at the ancestral temple.

12:49.960 --> 12:51.320
How dare you come here?

12:53.520 --> 12:54.520
Who are you people?

12:55.600 --> 12:56.440
Xiao!

12:59.280 --> 13:00.120
You're scaring her.

13:01.680 --> 13:03.400
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

13:04.160 --> 13:06.360
Xiao is my bodyguard.
He didn't scare you, did he?

13:07.040 --> 13:09.400
He's so crude and ill-mannered,
hardly like a bodyguard.

13:11.520 --> 13:12.960
When the Hutuo raided

13:13.040 --> 13:14.920
they seized Xiao's cattle and sheep.

13:15.440 --> 13:17.200
He chased them for miles and recovered

13:17.280 --> 13:18.840
half the herd with bare hands.

13:18.920 --> 13:23.000
Later, the governor robbed the people
and tried to flee the city.

13:23.080 --> 13:24.760
He even offered the Hutuo gold and silver.

13:26.640 --> 13:28.840
Xiao, what did you do?

13:28.920 --> 13:29.920
Chopped him into mincemeat.

13:31.280 --> 13:33.240
How can you keep someone like that around?

13:34.200 --> 13:37.240
My personal guards
are all refugees I've taken in.

13:37.920 --> 13:40.000
They're not bloodthirsty killers.

13:40.080 --> 13:42.720
This cruel world left them
no other choice.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.640
Don't worry.

13:44.720 --> 13:46.280
Xiao only cuts people up.
He doesn't eat them.

13:57.120 --> 13:57.960
Starting today,

13:58.880 --> 14:01.040
Hongxian will study etiquette with you.

14:01.720 --> 14:03.880
Changning, Changhui,
take good care of your new sister.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.720
Hongxian has only just arrived.

14:07.800 --> 14:09.600
She may not know
the capital's latest styles.

14:09.680 --> 14:12.160
I think we're about the same size.

14:12.240 --> 14:14.360
I have a few newly tailored dresses.

14:14.440 --> 14:16.280
They're all the latest styles.

14:16.360 --> 14:17.920
Xiao, you go and help Hongxian
answer questions.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.360
Aman, go with them.

14:27.480 --> 14:28.880
Have you decided on courtyards yet?

14:28.960 --> 14:31.200
Need anything? I'll get it for you.

14:31.920 --> 14:34.800
My Lord won't blame me
for scaring your sister, will you?

14:36.440 --> 14:37.280
Come on.

14:38.400 --> 14:39.240
I have something to show you.

14:53.880 --> 14:57.000
I had the servants
pull up all the flowers in this garden

14:57.080 --> 14:58.040
and plant alfalfa instead.

14:59.040 --> 15:01.080
It survives cold and drought
and grows easily.

15:01.160 --> 15:03.280
It makes horses strong and well-fed.

15:04.560 --> 15:06.960
Especially this purple alfalfa.

15:07.840 --> 15:09.320
Will it grow in barren hills and valleys?

15:10.200 --> 15:11.040
Why wouldn't it?

15:12.560 --> 15:13.560
Wei Rao.

15:13.640 --> 15:17.280
This humble weed
can turn wasteland into grazing land.

15:17.880 --> 15:20.440
The army needs plenty of fodder, too.

15:21.280 --> 15:25.480
You went to all that trouble
finding these seeds just to please me?

15:26.080 --> 15:28.920
Sounds like this gift
is just what you wanted.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.920
Your Ladyship.

15:41.480 --> 15:42.760
How will you thank me?

15:46.360 --> 15:50.520
I happen to have a fine sword
that cuts through iron like butter.

15:51.640 --> 15:52.960
How about I give you that?

16:02.840 --> 16:04.440
I've never been on a swing before.

16:04.960 --> 16:06.040
Give me a push.

16:20.440 --> 16:21.480
Where did you get that sword?

16:21.560 --> 16:22.640
General Qi gave it to me.

16:22.720 --> 16:25.200
He also gave me a bow he made himself.

16:26.000 --> 16:26.920
Push me higher.

16:44.120 --> 16:47.080
Why did you push so hard?

16:47.160 --> 16:48.000
Wei Rao.

16:49.800 --> 16:51.560
You didn't know what's love.

16:51.640 --> 16:55.040
Your heart is full of cold suspicion
and distrust.

16:56.360 --> 16:59.480
You keep testing me and hurting me.

17:00.400 --> 17:02.080
You tear my heart to pieces

17:03.040 --> 17:04.359
just to feel safe.

17:05.640 --> 17:07.440
But if you keep provoking me,

17:08.680 --> 17:11.680
there's no telling what I'll do next time.

17:13.440 --> 17:16.560
You knew what I was like,
yet you married me anyway.

17:17.560 --> 17:19.119
If you ever learn what love is,

17:22.680 --> 17:23.880
you'll have me by your side, and me only.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.720
What if I never learn,
not in this lifetime?

17:26.800 --> 17:27.960
Then in this lifetime,

17:28.760 --> 17:30.400
you'll still be mine.

17:39.800 --> 17:42.760
I don't know what my brother sees in her.

17:42.840 --> 17:46.360
He passed up the virtuous Lady Xie
to marry that temptress instead.

17:46.960 --> 17:48.400
Just look at the people she brought home.

17:49.000 --> 17:51.120
No. I'm telling Mother.

17:51.200 --> 17:52.480
We can't have fugitives living here.

17:53.080 --> 17:55.040
She has a noble title
and a fine reputation.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.880
Even Grandmother favors her.

17:56.960 --> 17:59.440
If you complain,
you'll only get yourself in trouble.

18:00.040 --> 18:02.160
So we just let her do whatever she wants?

18:03.160 --> 18:04.400
What's got you so worked up?

18:04.920 --> 18:06.600
My lady,
we've had little rain this spring.

18:06.680 --> 18:08.320
Second Madam ordered
the backyard wells cleaned.

18:08.920 --> 18:11.440
And in one of the wells,
we… we found a body!

18:12.040 --> 18:13.800
We were just about to report it
to Second Madam.

18:14.440 --> 18:15.280
Which well?

18:15.360 --> 18:16.920
The one behind Songyue Hall.

18:17.000 --> 18:18.400
The abandoned well in the woods.

18:22.720 --> 18:24.960
Come on. Let's take a look.

18:27.640 --> 18:28.480
Your Ladyship.

18:28.560 --> 18:30.480
They found something in the woods
behind Songyue Hall.

18:30.560 --> 18:31.920
A body.

18:41.640 --> 18:44.040
Your Grace. Grandmother.

18:45.160 --> 18:47.640
Governess Miao, tell her.

18:48.760 --> 18:49.640
Your Ladyship.

18:49.720 --> 18:52.560
The body pulled from the garden well today

18:52.640 --> 18:55.480
has been identified
as one of your attendants.

18:55.560 --> 18:56.400
Governess Wu.

18:57.360 --> 18:58.320
Governess Wu?

18:59.760 --> 19:01.000
Your Ladyship,

19:01.080 --> 19:03.840
you've only just married into the family.

19:03.920 --> 19:05.280
We shouldn't
have to trouble you with this.

19:05.880 --> 19:08.240
But the imperial court
issued a decree long ago.

19:08.320 --> 19:11.720
Anyone who abuses a servant to death
must be severely punished with a beating.

19:12.480 --> 19:15.640
And Governess Wu
came with you from the Wei family.

19:15.720 --> 19:17.720
Given her age and position,

19:17.800 --> 19:20.360
she deserved even greater respect.

19:20.440 --> 19:23.160
How could you have her killed on a whim?

19:23.800 --> 19:24.960
Of course, in noble households,

19:25.760 --> 19:28.720
a servant or two dying isn't unusual.

19:28.800 --> 19:30.920
The authorities don't act
unless someone reports it.

19:31.000 --> 19:33.040
-That's right.
-But a family like ours,

19:33.840 --> 19:35.480
known for honor and integrity,

19:35.560 --> 19:39.640
cannot afford a reputation
for abusing servants to death!

19:39.720 --> 19:42.120
-What a disgrace that would be!
-Enough.

19:42.800 --> 19:45.600
The Lu ancestors
defended the nation and its people.

19:45.680 --> 19:47.080
Brave generals died in battles.

19:47.720 --> 19:50.520
Their loyalty and courage
are still praised today.

19:50.600 --> 19:53.520
If our family welcomed a cruel,
murderous daughter-in-law,

19:53.600 --> 19:56.800
what would the world
think of the Lu family?

19:58.080 --> 20:00.120
We don't even know how she died.

20:00.200 --> 20:03.720
Perhaps she slipped
and fell into the well at night.

20:04.920 --> 20:05.840
Aunt.

20:06.440 --> 20:07.880
Those woods are deserted.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.760
No one ever goes there.

20:10.720 --> 20:12.400
If Her Ladyship did kill her by accident,

20:13.120 --> 20:16.200
she should admit it now
so we can decide what to do.

20:16.800 --> 20:18.680
If a censor brings charges later,

20:18.760 --> 20:20.800
we'll be ready to handle it

20:20.880 --> 20:23.200
without dragging my cousin into this.

20:23.280 --> 20:24.560
Enough.

20:25.080 --> 20:27.800
-What proof do you have?
-Bring it in.

20:38.320 --> 20:39.520
See?

20:39.600 --> 20:40.440
What's the meaning of this?

20:41.440 --> 20:43.120
The silver needle
was inserted into her throat.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.080
It came out completely black.

20:45.160 --> 20:48.000
Governess Wu was clearly poisoned!

20:52.440 --> 20:55.680
If you had nothing to do with her death,

20:55.760 --> 20:59.440
why were you so certain
she'd returned to the Wei residence?

21:04.480 --> 21:07.800
Rao, dear, what on earth happened?

21:09.800 --> 21:11.400
I'll smash your head in!

21:16.040 --> 21:17.960
I do owe this family an explanation.

21:19.640 --> 21:20.960
-That's…
-You're asking the wrong person!

21:26.120 --> 21:27.200
You should be asking me.

21:33.320 --> 21:34.400
Grandfather, Grandmother.

21:35.080 --> 21:36.200
There's no need to pressure Wei Rao.

21:37.720 --> 21:38.640
She's taking the blame for me.

21:43.680 --> 21:44.800
Taking the blame for you?

21:47.440 --> 21:50.520
That old woman snuck into my study
and tried to read my military reports.

21:51.280 --> 21:53.720
Zhao Song caught her in the act.
She took poison and killed herself.

21:54.480 --> 21:56.040
I meant to have her body removed,

21:56.120 --> 21:57.760
but I didn't want to alert
her accomplices.

21:58.280 --> 21:59.680
I feared the news
would upset Her Ladyship.

21:59.760 --> 22:01.080
So I had the body disposed quietly.

22:02.400 --> 22:04.680
After that, I suspected
there were more spies in the residence.

22:04.760 --> 22:08.040
-So I set a trap to catch them.
-My dear.

22:12.200 --> 22:13.240
I know you can't bear to do it.

22:13.320 --> 22:15.200
But national security was at stake.

22:15.280 --> 22:18.360
Leaving her body intact
was already more mercy than she deserved.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.000
Zhuo.

22:20.080 --> 22:21.480
Even if that old woman was a spy,

22:22.080 --> 22:23.760
she served Her Ladyship.

22:23.840 --> 22:26.200
How can you say
she had nothing to do with it?

22:29.960 --> 22:31.280
What else are you suggesting?

22:32.240 --> 22:34.400
-That Wei Rao is a spy, too?
-I…

22:34.480 --> 22:35.440
If she were a spy,

22:35.520 --> 22:37.960
Han Liao would've framed
the Lu family successfully.

22:38.040 --> 22:39.760
You wouldn't be standing here
spouting nonsense!

22:41.600 --> 22:43.200
I spoke out of turn.

22:43.800 --> 22:47.000
But I was only
looking out for you and the Lu family.

22:48.160 --> 22:49.440
What's so surprising about that?

22:50.040 --> 22:53.080
Even in Lu Zhuo's Songyue Hall,
that servant Anfu

22:53.160 --> 22:54.440
was bribed into a traitor, right?

22:55.040 --> 22:58.440
Traitors are everywhere.
You can never be too careful.

22:59.640 --> 23:01.400
Rao, none of this is your fault.

23:01.480 --> 23:03.320
I'm sorry you had such a fright.

23:05.120 --> 23:06.120
Thank you, Grandmother.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.960
When I learned my servant had done wrong,
I was terrified.

23:10.560 --> 23:12.560
I should've told the elders sooner.

23:12.640 --> 23:14.000
The misunderstanding today
could be avoided.

23:16.040 --> 23:18.760
She was a spy. Killing her was justified.

23:18.840 --> 23:21.360
You couldn't even get the facts straight.

23:21.440 --> 23:22.800
Is this how you run the household?

23:22.880 --> 23:24.560
You've made fools of us all.

23:24.640 --> 23:27.040
I… I failed to look into it properly.

23:27.120 --> 23:29.280
I nearly accused an innocent woman.

23:29.360 --> 23:30.400
Please forgive me.

23:33.560 --> 23:34.800
I'm at fault, too.

23:34.880 --> 23:36.480
I should've asked Lu Zhuo first.

23:36.560 --> 23:37.640
Yes.

23:37.720 --> 23:41.360
An upright heart leads to upright conduct.

23:41.440 --> 23:42.480
Enough.

23:43.000 --> 23:44.480
The matter is settled.

23:44.560 --> 23:45.600
You may all leave.

23:50.800 --> 23:51.880
What are you around for?

23:51.960 --> 23:53.600
Waiting for a reward?

23:59.120 --> 24:00.040
Rao.

24:00.920 --> 24:03.200
Come rest with me.

24:04.520 --> 24:05.520
Pay them no mind.

24:05.600 --> 24:08.920
Don't let such petty troubles
weigh on your heart.

24:19.200 --> 24:21.280
What's gotten into you, child?
What were you thinking?

24:21.360 --> 24:24.000
Back in the hall, you didn't stand up
for your cousin-in-law.

24:24.080 --> 24:26.080
Instead, you stirred up trouble
for an outsider!

24:26.160 --> 24:29.320
Aunt. It was only a servant who died.

24:29.400 --> 24:32.080
Do you really think the court
would punish Her Ladyship for that?

24:33.200 --> 24:36.600
They made a fuss
just to put Her Ladyship in her place

24:37.200 --> 24:39.200
so she wouldn't be so overbearing.

24:40.240 --> 24:43.480
Aunt. I was looking out for you, too.

24:43.560 --> 24:44.800
A daughter-in-law
outranking her mother-in-law,

24:44.880 --> 24:45.920
and doing whatever she pleases,

24:46.000 --> 24:47.520
is bound to cause trouble someday.

24:49.280 --> 24:50.400
If Mother keeps listening to her schemes,

24:51.000 --> 24:52.800
there'll be no end to the trouble.

24:52.880 --> 24:54.920
-Zhuo, you've misunderstood.
-Mother.

24:55.640 --> 24:57.320
Weiyu belongs to the He family.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.880
It's time she went back to her family.

24:59.480 --> 25:01.400
Let Uncle arrange a marriage for her.

25:01.480 --> 25:04.840
Zhuo, what… what did I do wrong?

25:04.920 --> 25:05.840
Are you sending me away?

25:06.440 --> 25:07.920
Aunt, you…

25:08.720 --> 25:12.560
Zhuo, dear.
Your cousin Weiyu grew up by my side.

25:12.640 --> 25:15.520
She's no different
from my own daughter now.

25:15.600 --> 25:18.000
She's young and doesn't know any better.

25:18.080 --> 25:21.840
She said some foolish things, but surely
that's no reason to send her away.

25:21.920 --> 25:22.880
I'm trying to save her.

25:23.560 --> 25:26.400
Wei Rao's maids are
mostly palace old-timers.

25:26.920 --> 25:27.880
Lady Li sent them

25:28.480 --> 25:30.440
to make sure her daughter
was treated well.

25:31.080 --> 25:32.600
You stirred up trouble against her.

25:32.680 --> 25:35.080
and accused Her Ladyship
of killing a servant.

25:35.680 --> 25:37.200
If word reaches the palace tomorrow,

25:38.160 --> 25:39.960
what do you think will happen to you?

25:40.040 --> 25:42.320
Zhuo, I didn't!

25:42.920 --> 25:43.960
Please save me!

25:44.680 --> 25:45.720
Weiyu!

25:45.800 --> 25:49.320
Rao's mother adores her daughter.

25:49.400 --> 25:50.480
How could you be so foolish?

25:51.280 --> 25:54.160
Zhuo, I understand what you're saying.

25:54.240 --> 25:57.480
I'll write to my brother at once
and have him take her home.

25:57.560 --> 25:59.240
Until the He family comes for her,

25:59.320 --> 26:00.760
I'll keep her to her room.

26:00.840 --> 26:02.400
She won't be allowed to wander around.

26:03.120 --> 26:09.880
Could you do me a favor
and apologize to Rao on Weiyu's behalf?

26:09.960 --> 26:12.360
-Aunt!
-Please, say no more.

26:12.960 --> 26:15.840
Weiyu may be foolish,
but at least Mother knows better.

26:16.440 --> 26:18.120
-I know. I know.
-Zhuo!

26:18.200 --> 26:19.320
I did it because I love you.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.280
That's why I said those things.

26:21.360 --> 26:23.120
But I haven't done anything serious.

26:23.200 --> 26:25.680
I know I was wrong! I really do!

26:25.760 --> 26:27.360
Zhuo! You…

26:27.440 --> 26:28.800
I'll leave her alone from now on.

26:29.560 --> 26:31.800
I worked so hard to keep her by my side.

26:32.320 --> 26:33.360
And you tried to drive her away

26:34.080 --> 26:35.720
and come between my wife and me.

26:35.800 --> 26:36.840
That is unforgivable.

26:38.040 --> 26:39.320
Send her back soon.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.840
I don't want to see her again.

26:41.480 --> 26:42.480
Zhuo!

26:43.040 --> 26:45.720
-Zhuo! My cousin!
-That's enough! Stop.

26:45.800 --> 26:46.800
Be quiet!

27:06.960 --> 27:08.360
No matter who you're angry with,

27:08.440 --> 27:10.440
don't take it out on your health.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.760
Rice porridge is good for your stomach.

27:15.840 --> 27:16.880
At least have a little.

27:28.480 --> 27:29.440
Why?

27:33.680 --> 27:34.920
Who asked you to lie for me?

27:39.160 --> 27:40.120
Try it.

27:41.600 --> 27:42.560
Answer me.

27:43.800 --> 27:44.680
Answer what?

27:46.120 --> 27:47.160
That night,

27:48.080 --> 27:49.160
by the well,

27:49.840 --> 27:51.280
you clearly saw me there.

27:51.880 --> 27:53.080
I lied to you.

27:53.600 --> 27:56.040
Don't you want to know
how Governess Wu died?

27:56.720 --> 27:59.760
Maybe I was afraid
she'd expose my identity,

27:59.840 --> 28:01.520
so I killed her to keep her quiet.

28:01.600 --> 28:02.800
Lu Zhuo!

28:02.880 --> 28:05.680
You covered for me without even asking!

28:06.880 --> 28:07.800
Because I trust you.

28:10.120 --> 28:11.480
You'd never harm the innocent.

28:16.480 --> 28:20.520
You're a man of honor,
with integrity beyond reproach.

28:21.040 --> 28:22.040
Please don't do it again.

28:23.080 --> 28:24.160
Don't do what?

28:26.000 --> 28:27.520
Don't keep giving in for my sake.

28:28.800 --> 28:30.680
Don't compromise your principles for me.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.480
And don't lie for me again.

28:41.800 --> 28:45.160
Everyone wants the person they love
to be sincere and innocent,

28:45.680 --> 28:47.000
kind and selfless.

28:48.960 --> 28:49.800
But that's not who you are.

28:51.520 --> 28:52.920
And that's fine.

28:54.000 --> 28:58.200
Whether you had no other choice
or you're coldhearted by nature,

29:02.880 --> 29:04.000
as long as it's you,

29:05.640 --> 29:06.760
I'll always help you.

29:16.640 --> 29:21.760
Marriages between noble families
are built on mutual respect and courtesy.

29:22.480 --> 29:25.760
When hardship strikes,
the families could support each other,

29:25.840 --> 29:27.280
and that's enough for a good marriage.

29:27.360 --> 29:28.520
You…

29:32.600 --> 29:33.800
You don't have to be so good to me.

29:34.920 --> 29:36.160
Wei Rao.

29:36.240 --> 29:38.240
Crossing boundaries means losing control!

29:38.320 --> 29:39.560
And I hate losing control!

29:49.200 --> 29:51.240
I'm sure the Duke
has warned you repeatedly

29:52.040 --> 29:53.960
not to get carried away by romance.

29:54.040 --> 29:55.840
We must listen to our elders.

29:56.360 --> 29:58.720
I've sent your military books
and bedding to the study.

29:59.440 --> 30:01.160
You're heartless.

30:01.240 --> 30:04.520
We're newlyweds,
and you're already kicking me out?

30:04.600 --> 30:08.120
Your noble families believe
too much indulgence shortens one's life.

30:09.280 --> 30:11.800
From now on, we should share a bed
on the first and fifteenth of each month.

30:12.840 --> 30:14.680
I'm tired. You may go, My Lord.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.960
It's only been two days.

30:20.920 --> 30:22.520
Good night, My Lord.

30:33.760 --> 30:38.000
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

31:02.400 --> 31:03.760
You're certainly on your guard,
Your Ladyship.

31:05.600 --> 31:06.800
Get off the bed.

31:06.880 --> 31:08.520
You know I can help you.

31:08.600 --> 31:10.200
You should be holding on to me.

31:10.280 --> 31:11.640
Why do you keep pushing me away?

31:12.800 --> 31:14.440
What are you so afraid of?

31:15.120 --> 31:16.480
That you'll depend on me too much?

31:17.000 --> 31:17.960
Or…

31:19.880 --> 31:21.240
Are you afraid falling in love with me?

31:27.640 --> 31:29.800
You think awfully highly of yourself,
My Lord.

31:40.040 --> 31:41.320
Well, I'm not leaving.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.720
I told you not to marry me.

31:50.560 --> 31:54.000
Tell me, what kind of couple
is as strange as we are?

31:54.680 --> 31:56.800
Then we'll be a strange couple.

31:57.720 --> 32:01.720
You can hate me or refuse to love me
for the rest of your life.

32:01.800 --> 32:03.880
We can fight every single day.

32:05.280 --> 32:06.880
I'll still hold you in my arms.

32:08.840 --> 32:10.240
Let's get by together.

32:10.320 --> 32:11.880
A lifetime between you and me.

32:12.480 --> 32:14.720
-How is that not love?
-You…

32:16.760 --> 32:17.920
I'm tired.

32:24.480 --> 32:26.200
You brought this on yourself.

32:26.920 --> 32:30.400
Once I claim something as mine,
I'd rather die than let it go.

32:31.840 --> 32:33.840
So never ask me to let you go.

32:34.440 --> 32:36.280
Not in this life or any other.

32:56.760 --> 32:58.000
What's wrong?

32:59.720 --> 33:01.040
You're freezing cold, My Lord.

33:01.120 --> 33:02.520
I don't want to sleep next to you.

33:02.600 --> 33:03.960
Go sleep at the other end.

33:13.160 --> 33:16.040
I forgot you can't stand the cold.
My mistake.

33:23.040 --> 33:25.360
Allow me to warm your bed, Your Ladyship.

33:25.440 --> 33:26.560
Lu Zhuo!

33:38.480 --> 33:41.040
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

33:56.000 --> 33:59.120
Your Ladyship lends grain to the villagers
using a large measure,

33:59.200 --> 34:00.640
but asks to repay with a smaller one.

34:01.240 --> 34:02.600
To thank Your Ladyship,

34:02.680 --> 34:04.480
they pick the freshest wild greens
in the hills

34:04.560 --> 34:06.280
and carry them all the way into town.

34:06.360 --> 34:08.560
You refuse them,
so they leave the greens and run.

34:09.080 --> 34:12.000
They bring more every day.
What should we do?

34:18.520 --> 34:20.080
Your Ladyship, the Fourth Prince is here.

34:20.159 --> 34:21.080
Rao!

34:21.840 --> 34:22.760
Rao!

34:24.199 --> 34:25.239
Put them down.

34:26.520 --> 34:27.560
Rao.

34:27.639 --> 34:29.560
These fresh oranges
are tribute from the south.

34:29.639 --> 34:31.320
Mother told me to bring them all to you.

34:33.480 --> 34:34.880
That's a lot of wild greens.

34:34.960 --> 34:36.000
Can you eat them all, Rao?

34:36.679 --> 34:38.120
No, I can't. Take them with you.

34:40.000 --> 34:41.080
Your Highness.

34:41.159 --> 34:43.000
You are not here only for the oranges,
right?

34:43.960 --> 34:45.719
Nothing gets past you, Zhuo.

34:46.560 --> 34:49.239
The palace is hosting a spring banquet.
I was sent to invite you, my sister.

34:50.679 --> 34:51.880
Come, Rao.

34:53.600 --> 34:55.400
Lady Zheng wants to host

34:55.480 --> 34:56.679
a peace offering between you
and the Crown Princess.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.520
A peace offering?

34:59.240 --> 35:02.040
On the Spring Purification Festival,
you may bring her to the palace with you.

35:02.120 --> 35:04.520
Have a drink together
and bury the hatchet.

35:04.600 --> 35:05.640
Then Mother can be at ease.

35:08.080 --> 35:09.440
And this peace offering…

35:10.200 --> 35:11.040
Am I invited?

35:11.840 --> 35:13.520
It's a spring banquet
for the palace ladies.

35:13.600 --> 35:15.360
You're of course not invited.

35:15.440 --> 35:18.000
But Mother will be there,
so you have nothing to worry about.

35:20.040 --> 35:22.200
Since Lady Zheng has been so gracious,

35:23.960 --> 35:25.040
I'd be happy to accept.

35:26.960 --> 35:28.280
Take these baskets to the kitchen.

35:28.880 --> 35:31.160
Mulberries spoil quickly.
Share them with everyone.

35:31.680 --> 35:32.640
Yes.

35:37.000 --> 35:40.000
Every time I go to the palace,
something bad happens.

35:42.240 --> 35:44.920
Lady Zheng's brother, Zheng Tan,
is clever and capable.

35:45.720 --> 35:49.480
But the younger generation
is mostly mediocre and spoiled.

35:50.000 --> 35:51.000
Not one fit for major roles.

35:57.040 --> 35:58.000
Now you've married me,

35:59.280 --> 36:00.800
the Zheng family is even more anxious.

36:03.040 --> 36:05.880
You're that intimidating, Lord Lu?

36:06.800 --> 36:08.400
Then I should've married you sooner.

36:11.160 --> 36:12.840
Whatever they're planning,

36:13.720 --> 36:16.800
we'll deal with it when the time comes.

36:28.200 --> 36:30.520
These oranges are sweet and tangy.
Want to try one?

36:34.480 --> 36:35.520
Here, take it.

36:49.920 --> 36:51.120
Lady Hongxian.

36:55.240 --> 36:56.440
Here.

37:16.000 --> 37:18.520
SPRING PURIFICATION FESTIVAL

37:27.320 --> 37:28.520
Your Highness.

37:28.600 --> 37:31.760
I hear you have grown close
to the Crown Princess lately.

37:32.440 --> 37:34.880
Forgive me for saying this,
but the Crown Princess is no kind soul.

37:35.640 --> 37:38.120
You're beautiful, gentle and gracious.

37:38.720 --> 37:41.880
Don't let her manipulate you
into making trouble for my sister.

37:43.120 --> 37:44.960
You've been spying on me, Your Highness.

37:45.040 --> 37:46.640
Now you have the nerve to question me?

37:47.680 --> 37:50.360
Your sister is ambitious and arrogant.

37:50.440 --> 37:51.720
Why should I put up with her?

37:53.920 --> 37:56.160
While you practiced music
and painting beneath the wisteria,

37:56.680 --> 37:59.000
my sister's hands
were raw from forced labor.

37:59.520 --> 38:00.840
The world has never been kind to her.

38:01.440 --> 38:03.920
Yet she gives everything
she has to help those in need.

38:05.200 --> 38:08.160
How can you bring yourself
to hurt someone like her, Hualou?

38:09.440 --> 38:11.160
Your sister stole the man I love.

38:12.560 --> 38:15.240
Is my brother-in-law the only brave,
handsome man in the world?

38:16.400 --> 38:17.720
Beautiful as you are,

38:17.800 --> 38:20.240
surely you can find another husband.

38:22.080 --> 38:23.520
Don't you know?

38:24.040 --> 38:25.640
I'm about to marry Prince Fu.

38:26.160 --> 38:27.200
I don't have a choice.

38:28.040 --> 38:31.120
If you want a husband of noble birth,

38:32.640 --> 38:35.160
am I not a prince, too?

38:36.920 --> 38:38.200
Have you lost your mind?

38:38.280 --> 38:40.120
You're four years younger than me!

38:40.200 --> 38:41.600
How dare you toy with me like this?

38:42.520 --> 38:46.360
A beautiful lady like you
has a heart worth more than gold.

38:47.400 --> 38:50.440
Even if you've done something wrong,
someone else must have led you astray.

38:55.400 --> 38:56.320
Promise me.

38:56.960 --> 38:58.240
Don't go against your own heart

38:58.840 --> 39:00.800
just to make an enemy of my sister.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.000
Please?

39:07.040 --> 39:10.280
If you'll only give me a chance, Hualou,
what's a four-year age gap?

39:10.360 --> 39:12.080
Age difference wouldn't matter.

39:12.160 --> 39:13.360
I wouldn't care.

39:28.320 --> 39:30.360
-That was so close! Try again.
-So close!

39:31.120 --> 39:32.240
Go play with them.

39:50.400 --> 39:51.480
Lady Li.

39:52.640 --> 39:53.720
Lady Zheng.

39:53.800 --> 39:55.200
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

39:55.280 --> 39:56.200
Lady Wang.

39:56.720 --> 39:57.760
Rao.

40:03.120 --> 40:04.640
You needn't trouble yourself,
Crown Princess.

40:04.720 --> 40:06.720
We're sisters.
Rank doesn't matter between us.

40:07.480 --> 40:09.840
Things have been tense between us lately.

40:09.920 --> 40:11.320
As your older sister, I was at fault.

40:11.400 --> 40:13.680
I was thoughtless and hurt your feelings.

40:14.680 --> 40:16.360
I sincerely apologize.

40:16.440 --> 40:18.240
I hope you'll find it in your heart

40:18.320 --> 40:22.000
to put our differences behind us
so we can be close again.

40:24.440 --> 40:27.200
Everyone knows your sister is generous.

40:27.280 --> 40:29.760
Besides, you both bear the Wei name.

40:29.840 --> 40:30.720
You're family, after all.

40:30.800 --> 40:36.240
Making such a grand apology
only makes her seem petty.

40:41.960 --> 40:43.200
Thank you.

40:50.400 --> 40:53.000
Rao, you must be tired. Go sit down.

41:02.920 --> 41:05.240
Rao. You haven't met her yet.

41:06.200 --> 41:07.240
This is Yi Jiang.

41:07.320 --> 41:08.960
She serves Prince Fu.

41:09.560 --> 41:11.520
She's skilled at divination
and reading faces.

41:11.600 --> 41:16.840
Just now, she even helped Lady Wang
find her missing pearl bracelet.

41:16.920 --> 41:19.080
Yi Jiang, come here.

41:20.120 --> 41:21.840
Read my Rao's face, would you?

41:23.960 --> 41:24.840
Yes, Your Ladyship.

41:28.440 --> 41:29.520
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

41:30.160 --> 41:31.280
No need for formalities.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.120
YI JIANG, PRINCE FU'S FAVORITE CONCUBINE

41:33.200 --> 41:35.800
Your forehead is broad.
Your eyes shine like morning stars.

41:36.600 --> 41:39.480
That shows wisdom, clarity,
and keen insight.

41:39.560 --> 41:42.400
Your upper features are open,
and your jaw commands respect.

41:42.480 --> 41:44.200
You were born for greatness.

41:45.320 --> 41:46.320
Thank you for your kind words.

41:47.560 --> 41:48.960
Your Highness once had a sister.

41:49.880 --> 41:51.560
Your fates are at odds.

41:52.240 --> 41:55.400
Like two stars that never share the sky,

41:55.480 --> 41:58.400
you must never meet again
if you wish to live.

41:58.920 --> 42:00.560
Otherwise…

42:00.640 --> 42:01.800
Otherwise what?

42:02.960 --> 42:05.760
Your Highness already knows the answer.

42:06.920 --> 42:08.120
There's more.

42:08.200 --> 42:10.640
You face three deadly trials
in your lifetime.

42:10.720 --> 42:12.280
Each time, more dangerous than the last.

42:12.880 --> 42:16.360
I pray you earn enough good fortune
to survive them all.

42:28.560 --> 42:30.120
Deadly trials?

42:30.200 --> 42:31.920
What if she can't get through it?

42:32.000 --> 42:33.760
Bloodshed and death hang over her.

42:34.760 --> 42:36.880
If she cannot get through it,

42:36.960 --> 42:39.720
then I'm afraid
her death is fast approaching.

42:39.800 --> 42:42.760
She will not live past her twenties.

44:57.320 --> 44:59.440
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
